    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5764" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">būbīle</span></b>  (access. form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bŏvīle</span></b> , unus.
